        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/out-of-bounds-read-wrapped-length-arithmetic",
          "ruleIndex": 3,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "out-of-bounds read / wrapped length arithmetic — Ruled out: puredb/src/puredb_read.c puredb_find() record parsing\n\nThe suspicious check at puredb_read.c:277 (data_size > db->size - data) can only wrap if data > db->size, but the preceding read_be_long(db, data, &data_size) rejects offset > size-4 in both the mapped path (:53) and the lseek/read path (:60-66), and puredb_read() re-validates offset/len at :306-309 before any copy."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "puredb/src/puredb_read.c puredb_find() record parsing"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "strix": {
              "coverage_outcome": "ruled_out",
              "risk_area": "out-of-bounds read / wrapped length arithmetic",
              "surface": "puredb/src/puredb_read.c puredb_find() record parsing",
              "recorded_by": "Static Baseline Triage",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/per-user-ip-allow-deny-bypass-cidr-parsing-address-family-confusion",
          "ruleIndex": 4,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "per-user IP allow/deny bypass (CIDR parsing, address family confusion) — Ruled out: src/log_puredb.c access_ip_match()/access_ip_check()\n\naccess_ip_match() returns -1 for malformed IPv4/IPv6 CIDR (log_puredb.c:102-106, 146-161) and access_ip_check() denies on any non-1 result (:229-244), so malformed rules fail closed; fourinsix() is applied to ctrlconn and peer before authentication (ftpd.c:4953,4969) so v4-mapped IPv6 peers cannot dodge IPv4 deny rules."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "src/log_puredb.c access_ip_match()/access_ip_check()"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "strix": {
              "coverage_outcome": "ruled_out",
              "risk_area": "per-user IP allow/deny bypass (CIDR parsing, address family confusion)",
              "surface": "src/log_puredb.c access_ip_match()/access_ip_check()",
              "recorded_by": "Static Baseline Triage",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/stack-exhaustion-unbounded-allocation-from-wire-length",
          "ruleIndex": 5,
          "kind": "pass",
