            "text": "Buffer overflow / unbounded value length in config parsing — No issue identified: src/simpleconf.c config parser\n\nCompiled simpleconf.c with ASan+UBSan and drove sc_build_command_line_from_file with the real simpleconf_ftpd.h entry table over 15 crafted configs: 100 KB value, 65530-char line, exactly-64 KB line, unterminated/empty quotes, `CertFileAndKey (a) (b) (c) (d)`, embedded NUL, missing trailing newline, blank/whitespace-only lines, 70000-char Include path. Result: no ASan/UBSan report, only clean syntax/property-not-found messages; arg template is capped at SC_MAX_ARG_LENGTH (E2BIG) and matches[] is bounds-checked (matches_len >= 10) before every add_to_matches."
